{
  "name": "POLWORD",
  "displayName": "The Seat's Word",
  "sourceFile": "POLWORD.txt",
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 1000,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      %pcf, I need a courier I can trust. A sealed letter",
        "<ce>      must reach _envoy_ at __envoy_ in ___envoy_.",
        "<ce>      It carries the word of _seat_ to the notables of",
        "<ce>      _region_, where _rival_ would have them hear no",
        "<ce>      voice but its own. Put it in _envoy_'s hand within",
        "<ce>      =traveltime_ days and the _gold_ gold is yours, and",
        "<ce>      _seat_ will count more friends in _region_.",
        "<ce>",
        "<ce>      Know this before you answer: this is a political",
        "<ce>      errand, and those set against _seat_ will think",
        "<ce>      the less of you for it: _against_.",
        "<ce>                     Will you carry it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1001,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      Then forget I spoke of it. Some letters are best",
        "<ce>                  left in the drawer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1002,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      Here it is, sealed with the mark of _seat_. Into",
        "<ce>      the hand of _envoy_ at __envoy_ in ___envoy_,",
        "<ce>      and no other. You have =traveltime_ days. Come back",
        "<ce>                 to me when it is done."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1003,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      The letter, %pcf. _envoy_ is still waiting on it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1004,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      So _envoy_ has it. Word will go round _region_",
        "<ce>      that _seat_ keeps its friends. Here is your _gold_",
        "<ce>                gold, as I promised."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1005,
      "lines": [
        "<ce>      A letter? From _seat_. I will read it, and think on",
        "<ce>      it. Tell them that _region_ has a long memory, for",
        "<ce>                friends and for enemies."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1010,
      "lines": [
        "%qdt:",
        " _qgiver_ of ___qgiver_ gave me a sealed letter",
        " carrying the word of _seat_ in _region_. I am to",
        " put it in the hand of _envoy_ at __envoy_ in",
        " ___envoy_ within =traveltime_ days, then return",
        " for my pay. Those set against _seat_ will think",
        " the less of me for it: _against_."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 1011,
      "lines": [
        "Honoured _envoy_,",
        "   _seat_ remembers its friends in _region_, and",
        " those who stand with it now will not be forgotten",
        " when _rival_ has had its day. Speak for us among",
        " your neighbours, and you will find us generous.",
        "                        In the name of _seat_"
      ]
    }
  ],
